Package: blueroute
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: BlueRoute maintainers <ekkus93@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: dbus, bluez, network-manager, polkitd, systemd
Description: Bluetooth PAN network management for Linux
 BlueRoute creates managed IPv4 networks over compatible Bluetooth PAN
 adapters. The daemon owns privileged networking operations; its command
 line client runs as the invoking user.
